 and full-powered versions!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2362050/extras/4177dd020f492350ca152ef92ce4f05e.poster.avif?t=1754029787\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2362050/extras/4177dd020f492350ca152ef92ce4f05e.webp?t=1754029787\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br>Take control of your favorite U.A. Students, Pro Heroes, and Villains, and utilize their unique Quirks to pummel, blast, and trick your foes.<br><br>Unleash the full suite of new battle features to emerge victorious on the battlefield.<br>Express all the power of your character in new and never-before-seen ways!",
